    },
    {
      "key": "t5c94995bf1441951",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The world of online trading has evolved beyond traditional stock exchanges. Today, traders use flexible derivatives like CFDs (Contracts for Difference) to access global markets, speculate on price movements, and diversify portfolios—all without owning the underlying asset. Among the most popular CFD categories is CFD index trading, which allows traders to trade entire markets.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">オンライン取引は、従来の証券取引所の枠を超えて進化しています。現在、トレーダーはCFD（差金決済取引）などの柔軟なデリバティブを使い、原資産を所有せずに世界市場にアクセスし、値動きに投機し、ポートフォリオを分散できます。人気のCFDカテゴリーの一つが指数CFD取引で、市場全体を取引できます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t04a4f03e0159695e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A Contract for Difference is a financial derivative that lets traders speculate on the price movement of an underlying asset without actually owning it. The trader and broker exchange the difference between the opening and closing price of the contract.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差額契約は、トレーダーが実際に資産を所有することなく、原資産の価格変動を推測できる金融デリバティブです。トレーダーとブローカーは、契約の始値と終値の差を交換します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4c2b39480b77d5da",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Diversification</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">多様化</span>"
    },
    {
